---
source: crates/cli/tests/native.rs
expression: run.stdout
---
One name in every case code uses: camelCase, snake_case, kebab-case…

Usage: tw case [OPTIONS] [VALUE]

Arguments:
  [VALUE]  The input itself; stdin when left out, or -

Options:
      --camel         camelCase
      --pascal        PascalCase
      --snake         snake_case
      --constant      CONSTANT_CASE
      --kebab         kebab-case
      --train         Train-Case
      --dot           dot.case
      --title         Title Case
      --sentence      Sentence case
  -i, --input <FILE>  Read the input from FILE
      --json          Write the result as JSON
      --no-newline    Do not end text output with a newline
  -h, --help          Print help
